WEBVTT

00:00:18.351 --> 00:00:21.981
Long have I awaited this moment, human filth.

00:00:21.981 --> 00:00:25.281
With the Subterranean and Deep Sea Kings gone,

00:00:25.281 --> 00:00:29.821
the planet will once more
belong to the Dinosaur Clan!

00:00:39.671 --> 00:00:42.041
Now leading target towards point Bravo.

00:00:42.631 --> 00:00:43.381
Roger.

00:00:44.881 --> 00:00:47.091
We are inbound and on schedule.

00:00:47.511 --> 00:00:50.091
We'll be on top of point Bravo shortly.

00:01:12.481 --> 00:01:16.991
UNPARALLELED PERIL

00:01:26.331 --> 00:01:30.081
ONE PUNCH

00:01:33.791 --> 00:01:35.541
THREE, TWO, ONE, KILL SHOT

00:01:35.541 --> 00:01:39.301
JOIN THE FIGHT, CERTAIN VICTORY, THE STRONGEST EVER

00:01:35.541 --> 00:01:39.301
SANJOU, HISSHOU, SHIJOU SAIKYOU

00:01:39.301 --> 00:01:41.301
WHAT WAS THAT? FRUSTRATION

00:01:39.301 --> 00:01:41.301
NAN DATTEN DA? FRUSTRATION

00:01:41.301 --> 00:01:42.801
THERE'S NO STOPPING ME

00:01:41.301 --> 00:01:42.801
ORE WA TOMARANAI

00:01:42.801 --> 00:01:46.931
ONE PUNCH, IT'S OVER, VICTORY AFTER VICTORY

00:01:42.801 --> 00:01:46.931
ONE PUNCH, KANRYOU, RENSENRENSHOU

00:01:46.931 --> 00:01:50.561
I WIN, I ALWAYS WIN, OVERWHELMINGLY

00:01:46.931 --> 00:01:50.561
ORE WA KATSU, TSUNE NI KATSU, ASSHOU

00:01:50.561 --> 00:01:54.401
POWER, GET POWER

00:01:54.401 --> 00:01:57.361
RIGHT TO THE VERY LIMIT

00:01:54.401 --> 00:01:57.361
GIRIGIRI GENKAI MADE

00:01:57.361 --> 00:01:58.571
HERO

00:01:58.571 --> 00:02:01.741
PEOPLE SHOWER ME WITH PRAISE

00:01:58.571 --> 00:02:01.741
ORE O TATAERU KOE YA

00:02:01.741 --> 00:02:04.781
BUT I DON'T DO THIS FOR THE FAME

00:02:01.741 --> 00:02:04.781
KASSAI NANTE HOSHIKU WA NAI SA

00:02:04.781 --> 00:02:06.031
HERO

00:02:06.031 --> 00:02:10.791
SO I JUST FIGHT EVIL IN SECRET

00:02:06.031 --> 00:02:10.791
DAKARA HITOSHIREZU AKU TO TATAKAU

00:02:10.791 --> 00:02:12.251
(NOBODY KNOWS WHO HE IS)

00:02:12.251 --> 00:02:16.421
COUNTLESS ENEMIES FILL THE SKY

00:02:12.251 --> 00:02:16.421
SORA OOI OSHIYOSERU TEKI

00:02:16.421 --> 00:02:19.501
BUT I WON'T TURN MY BACK AND FLEE

00:02:16.421 --> 00:02:19.501
ORE WA SE WO MUKE WA SHINAI

00:02:19.501 --> 00:02:20.841
HERO

00:02:20.841 --> 00:02:25.841
I'VE MADE UP MY MIND AND I WON'T GIVE IN

00:02:20.841 --> 00:02:25.841
NARABA YURUGINAKI KAKUGO SHITA TAME

00:02:25.841 --> 00:02:33.061
A FIGHTING HERO

00:02:25.841 --> 00:02:33.061
TATAKAU HERO

00:02:33.061 --> 00:02:39.611
A SOLITARY HERO

00:02:33.061 --> 00:02:39.611
KODOKU NA HERO

00:02:39.611 --> 00:02:44.611
I WANNA BE THE STRONGEST HERO

00:02:39.611 --> 00:02:44.611
I WANNA BE A SAIKYOU HERO

00:02:48.531 --> 00:02:50.831
And who are you?

00:02:51.751 --> 00:02:53.411
Hello? What is it?

00:02:54.421 --> 00:02:56.631
What do you mean, come back?!

00:02:56.631 --> 00:03:00.051
You're the one who said some weirdo monster woke up and flew me out here!

00:03:00.511 --> 00:03:02.091
Weirdo…?

00:03:02.091 --> 00:03:03.171
That's right.

00:03:03.171 --> 00:03:05.341
I was just about to start.

00:03:03.841 --> 00:03:06.471
Listen well! I am the Ancient King.

00:03:06.471 --> 00:03:12.561
As ruler of the dinosaurs who once ruled this planet,
I stand above all other life-for—

00:03:07.091 --> 00:03:10.441
Trouble? Give me a break!
Why should I even care?

00:03:10.441 --> 00:03:14.651
Hey, shut it! Can't you see I'm on the phone here?!

00:03:15.061 --> 00:03:16.771
I'm so sick of this.

00:03:16.771 --> 00:03:19.611
Who does he think he is? So big-headed!

00:03:21.531 --> 00:03:22.861
Are you done?

00:03:22.861 --> 00:03:25.401
Speaking of big heads, what's your deal?

00:03:25.401 --> 00:03:27.531
Am I supposed to be intimidated?

00:03:27.531 --> 00:03:31.161
Act brave while you still can, tiny human!

00:03:32.121 --> 00:03:34.421
Tiny?! How dare you?!

00:03:40.501 --> 00:03:43.551
Ah, so you aren't helpless!

00:03:43.551 --> 00:03:48.761
But if you intend to destroy me,
it'd take the likes of a giant meteor.

00:03:48.761 --> 00:03:51.271
Fine. Have it your way.

00:03:52.221 --> 00:03:53.771
Don't make me laugh.

00:04:05.071 --> 00:04:08.081
How about another 300-million-year nap?

00:04:19.171 --> 00:04:21.171
Rock-Crushing Fist of Flowing Water.

00:04:30.181 --> 00:04:32.061
It goes something like that.

00:04:32.061 --> 00:04:39.071
Advance Fearlessly
Towards One's Goal

00:04:32.471 --> 00:04:34.061
Want to try?

00:04:34.061 --> 00:04:39.071
You both seem like quick learners.
I bet you'll get the hang of it in no time.

00:04:39.481 --> 00:04:42.651
This is the cool thing you said
you wanted to show us?

00:04:42.651 --> 00:04:45.191
A sales pitch? I'll pass.

00:04:45.191 --> 00:04:47.071
You do it, Genos.

00:04:47.071 --> 00:04:48.951
No, I will also pass.

00:04:48.951 --> 00:04:52.701
I seek not the art of self-defense,
but raw destructive power.

00:04:52.701 --> 00:04:53.451
You punks!

00:04:53.451 --> 00:04:57.331
Advance Fearlessly
Towards One's Goal

00:04:53.871 --> 00:04:56.291
You dare mock our fighting style?!

00:04:56.291 --> 00:04:58.501
I, Charanko, the top student, challenge you—

00:05:00.121 --> 00:05:01.711
I-I give up!

00:05:02.961 --> 00:05:05.251
Is he really your best?

00:05:05.251 --> 00:05:07.341
Yeah…

00:05:07.341 --> 00:05:10.801
I heard your dojo was full of skilled fighters.

00:05:11.551 --> 00:05:14.481
Well, one of my disciples went wild.

00:05:14.971 --> 00:05:18.851
He beat my most skilled students so badly
they're all out of commission.

00:05:18.851 --> 00:05:22.271
The rest got scared and quit.

00:05:23.061 --> 00:05:24.821
He's that strong?

00:05:24.821 --> 00:05:25.731
What's his name?

00:05:26.481 --> 00:05:27.491
Garou.

00:05:30.361 --> 00:05:35.331
He was my top student at the time,
but I gave him a good beating and expelled him.

00:05:35.331 --> 00:05:37.161
You must pack a punch, old man.

00:05:37.161 --> 00:05:39.831
Hey! This is the famed hero, Silverfang!

00:05:40.541 --> 00:05:42.501
Class S, hero ranking 3.

00:05:42.501 --> 00:05:44.461
He flows like water, toying with his opponents,

00:05:44.461 --> 00:05:47.671
before delivering a blow like a
raging river smashing huge rocks!

00:05:47.671 --> 00:05:49.471
A master of martial arts!

00:05:49.801 --> 00:05:53.721
You only became a hero recently, right?

00:05:53.721 --> 00:05:56.221
You'll regret taking Bang-sensei lightly!

00:05:56.221 --> 00:05:57.351
Enough, Charanko!

00:05:57.811 --> 00:05:59.481
Do not disgrace us.

00:06:00.021 --> 00:06:03.351
Saitama is many times stronger than me.

00:06:03.351 --> 00:06:05.981
Sensei, you can't be serious…

00:06:05.981 --> 00:06:07.491
Mr. Silverfang!

00:06:08.231 --> 00:06:09.651
The Association sent me.

00:06:09.651 --> 00:06:12.871
An emergency summons has been
issued to all S-class heroes!

00:06:13.491 --> 00:06:16.241
Please come to Association Headquarters.

00:06:16.241 --> 00:06:18.751
Oh! Is that you, Mr. Genos?

00:06:18.751 --> 00:06:26.011
Advance Fearlessly
Towards One's Goal

00:06:19.161 --> 00:06:23.291
Since all S-class heroes have been summoned, please come as well.

00:06:24.291 --> 00:06:26.011
Is it a Dragon-level threat?

00:06:26.501 --> 00:06:27.921
Goodness me…

00:06:27.921 --> 00:06:30.721
Charanko, look after the dojo.

00:06:30.721 --> 00:06:31.761
Please take care!

00:06:31.761 --> 00:06:38.771
Advance Fearlessly
Towards One's Goal

00:06:32.171 --> 00:06:36.891
If all the S-class heroes are being summoned,
they may need your help too, Master.

00:06:37.431 --> 00:06:38.771
Will you come?

00:06:39.391 --> 00:06:41.771
I will, since I've got nothing to do.

00:06:41.771 --> 00:06:44.271
CITY A

00:06:41.771 --> 00:06:44.271
HERO ASSOCIATION HQ

00:06:49.531 --> 00:06:51.491
Oh ho, Silverfang!

00:06:51.491 --> 00:06:54.491
It's been a while, Atomic Samurai.

00:06:54.491 --> 00:06:57.071
I knew you'd come.

00:06:57.071 --> 00:06:59.371
You must be the cyborg Genos and…

00:06:59.371 --> 00:07:01.501
Hm? Who's this?

00:07:01.871 --> 00:07:04.831
This is the B-class hero Saitama.

00:07:04.831 --> 00:07:07.461
His exceptional talent will one day place him atop Class S, I'm sure,

00:07:07.461 --> 00:07:09.551
so we asked him to come.

00:07:09.551 --> 00:07:11.801
Hi, middle-aged hero dude!

00:07:11.801 --> 00:07:12.701
Nice to meet ya!

00:07:13.671 --> 00:07:17.301
No handshakes.
I only acknowledge the strong.

00:07:17.301 --> 00:07:21.681
Once you've climbed up to Class S,
I'll greet you properly.

00:07:21.681 --> 00:07:24.021
Besides, I'm not middle-aged yet.

00:07:24.021 --> 00:07:26.361
I'm only thirty-seven.

00:07:26.691 --> 00:07:29.321
Thirty-seven isn't middle-aged?

00:07:29.321 --> 00:07:30.521
I had no idea…

00:07:30.521 --> 00:07:33.361
Hey, who brought a B-class nobody along?

00:07:33.901 --> 00:07:36.701
Have you no shame?

00:07:36.701 --> 00:07:40.281
And even if you were invited,
a polite person would decline. The nerve!

00:07:40.281 --> 00:07:43.871
I bet you're only here for some creepy reason
like getting close to us S-class heroes.

00:07:44.291 --> 00:07:46.381
You disgust me. Get lost.

00:07:46.381 --> 00:07:50.761
Wh-Who's this sassy… kid? Is she lost?

00:07:51.381 --> 00:07:53.631
That is Tatsumaki. Class S, rank 2.

00:07:53.631 --> 00:07:56.181
"That"? I am not an object!

00:07:54.511 --> 00:07:57.341
She defeats monsters with her psychic powers.

00:07:57.341 --> 00:07:58.931
She is an esper.

00:07:58.931 --> 00:07:59.641
Oh yeah?

00:08:00.051 --> 00:08:02.181
It appears that everyone's here.

00:08:02.181 --> 00:08:03.391
We should join them.

00:08:04.481 --> 00:08:05.431
Hey…

00:08:05.431 --> 00:08:06.901
Stop ignoring me!

00:08:18.661 --> 00:08:22.911
CLASS S, RANK 17

00:08:18.661 --> 00:08:22.911
PURI-PURI PRISONER

00:08:19.661 --> 00:08:22.911
This may be my chance to get closer to Genos…

00:08:23.161 --> 00:08:27.501
CLASS S, RANK 16

00:08:23.161 --> 00:08:27.501
GENOS

00:08:24.161 --> 00:08:27.501
It must be serious.
Almost everyone is here.

00:08:27.751 --> 00:08:31.011
CLASS S, RANK 15

00:08:27.751 --> 00:08:31.011
METAL BAT

00:08:28.251 --> 00:08:31.001
Demon or Dragon, bring it on!

00:08:31.261 --> 00:08:35.011
CLASS S, RANK 14

00:08:31.261 --> 00:08:35.011
TANK-TOP MASTER

00:08:32.041 --> 00:08:35.011
Saitama? The name rings a bell…

00:08:35.261 --> 00:08:37.511
CLASS S, RANK 13

00:08:35.261 --> 00:08:37.511
FLASHY FLASH

00:08:37.761 --> 00:08:41.271
CLASS S, RANK 12

00:08:37.761 --> 00:08:41.271
WATCHDOG MAN

00:08:39.431 --> 00:08:41.261
Somebody farted.

00:08:41.521 --> 00:08:45.271
CLASS S, RANK 11

00:08:41.521 --> 00:08:45.271
SUPERALLOY BLACKLUSTER

00:08:41.931 --> 00:08:45.271
They're all checking out my guns. Hell yeah!

00:08:45.521 --> 00:08:48.271
CLASS S, RANK 10

00:08:45.521 --> 00:08:48.271
PIG GOD

00:08:48.521 --> 00:08:51.281
CLASS S, RANK 9

00:08:48.521 --> 00:08:51.281
DRIVE KNIGHT

00:08:51.531 --> 00:08:57.281
CLASS S, RANK 8

00:08:51.531 --> 00:08:57.281
ZOMBIEMAN

00:08:52.231 --> 00:08:54.981
No one looks particularly enthusiastic.

00:08:54.981 --> 00:08:57.281
And does that pig ever stop eating?

00:08:57.531 --> 00:09:00.791
CLASS S, RANK 7

00:08:57.531 --> 00:09:00.791
KING

00:09:01.041 --> 00:09:03.791
CLASS S, RANK 6

00:09:01.041 --> 00:09:03.791
METAL KNIGHT

00:09:02.041 --> 00:09:03.791
ABSENT

00:09:04.041 --> 00:09:09.291
CLASS S, RANK 5

00:09:04.041 --> 00:09:09.291
CHILD EMPEROR

00:09:04.871 --> 00:09:09.291
Rank 1's a no show again?
I was hoping to see him.

00:09:09.541 --> 00:09:14.631
CLASS S, RANK 4

00:09:09.541 --> 00:09:14.631
ATOMIC SAMURAI

00:09:10.001 --> 00:09:14.631
Is Silverfang going to take
those youngsters under his wing?

00:09:14.881 --> 00:09:18.971
CLASS S, RANK 3

00:09:14.881 --> 00:09:18.971
SILVERFANG

00:09:16.211 --> 00:09:18.971
So, why are we all here?

00:09:19.261 --> 00:09:24.351
CLASS S, RANK 2

00:09:19.261 --> 00:09:24.351
TORNADO OF TERROR

00:09:19.341 --> 00:09:24.351
Who knows? I dropped everything and got here
right away, only to be kept waiting for two hours.

00:09:24.601 --> 00:09:27.351
CLASS S, RANK 1

00:09:24.601 --> 00:09:27.351
BLAST

00:09:25.601 --> 00:09:27.351
ABSENT

00:09:27.601 --> 00:09:31.111
CLASS B, RANK 63

00:09:27.601 --> 00:09:31.111
SAITAMA

00:09:29.021 --> 00:09:30.191
Can I have some tea?

00:09:34.691 --> 00:09:36.191
My apologies for being late.

00:09:36.941 --> 00:09:41.661
We do not know the whereabouts of
Metal Knight or Blast, nor can we reach them.

00:09:41.661 --> 00:09:45.451
There's no reason to wait any longer,
so let's begin this emergency meeting.

00:09:45.781 --> 00:09:50.961
You can call me Sitch. I'm with the Association,
and I will be briefing you.

00:09:50.961 --> 00:09:53.341
Let's get right down to brass tacks.

00:09:53.831 --> 00:09:58.341
You heroes are here because you're the best of the best.

00:09:59.381 --> 00:10:02.381
And now, we're asking you to save the earth!

00:10:02.931 --> 00:10:09.021
However, even with your S-class ability, there is no guarantee of survival.

00:10:09.431 --> 00:10:11.141
Walking away also takes courage.

00:10:11.141 --> 00:10:14.771
Should you choose to do so now,
you will retain S-class status.

00:10:15.361 --> 00:10:20.781
But those who stay and hear me out will not be allowed to walk away.

00:10:20.781 --> 00:10:26.701
You will be confined here until the incident is over in order to avoid a general panic.

00:10:27.621 --> 00:10:30.701
Do you all still wish to stay?

00:10:30.701 --> 00:10:36.341
Whatever's going on,
it better be worth calling all of us here.

00:10:36.341 --> 00:10:40.301
I skipped out on my little sister's
piano recital for this.

00:10:40.301 --> 00:10:41.841
If it's a load of crap,

00:10:42.471 --> 00:10:44.891
I'm gonna tear this whole building apart.

00:10:45.471 --> 00:10:47.891
Like you could do that with that skinny stick.

00:10:47.891 --> 00:10:51.191
Yeah? How 'bout I bust your head open instead?

00:10:51.191 --> 00:10:54.441
You think you can?
Do your worst, pillbug-head!

00:10:54.851 --> 00:10:56.231
You wanna go, shorty?!

00:10:55.271 --> 00:10:57.441
Hurry up and get on with it.

00:10:57.441 --> 00:11:00.191
Otherwise Mr. Pompadour here is going to die.

00:11:00.731 --> 00:11:03.951
Hey, Hairpins, you siding with the girl?

00:11:04.411 --> 00:11:08.201
The great seer, Madame Shibabawa, is dead!

00:11:08.661 --> 00:11:11.501
Shibabawa? Was she killed?

00:11:11.501 --> 00:11:11.831
No.

00:11:12.371 --> 00:11:15.251
While looking into the future for the next six months,

00:11:15.251 --> 00:11:17.671
she became agitated and had a coughing fit.

00:11:17.671 --> 00:11:22.971
She popped a cough drop in her mouth
and ended up choking on it…

00:11:22.971 --> 00:11:23.591
I get it!

00:11:24.301 --> 00:11:28.641
So we have to figure out how to prevent disasters
without the help of predictions.

00:11:28.641 --> 00:11:30.851
That's the focus of this meeting.

00:11:31.221 --> 00:11:32.561
No.

00:11:32.561 --> 00:11:36.611
Madame Shibabawa was only able to predict a handful of disasters.

00:11:37.021 --> 00:11:37.941
Excuse me!

00:11:38.651 --> 00:11:39.821
Hey, you there.

00:11:41.321 --> 00:11:44.241
Who was this Shibabawa? A hero?

00:11:44.241 --> 00:11:45.491
You don't know?

00:11:46.071 --> 00:11:48.321
She was a seer. A great one at that.

00:11:48.321 --> 00:11:51.501
She correctly predicted
earthquakes and monster attacks.

00:11:52.081 --> 00:11:56.671
We've gotten through many crises without
Madame Shibabawa's predictions.

00:11:56.671 --> 00:12:01.001
But even so, we provided a bodyguard and gave her special treatment.

00:12:01.001 --> 00:12:05.551
Yes, because her few predictions
were 100% accurate.

00:12:06.221 --> 00:12:08.011
The crux of the problem, though,

00:12:08.011 --> 00:12:12.181
is her last, greatest prophecy.

00:12:12.181 --> 00:12:17.061
Even as she choked on that final cough drop,
she managed to leave this note.

00:12:18.061 --> 00:12:21.651
It is a prophecy that will absolutely come to pass.

00:12:21.651 --> 00:12:22.651
Here it is!

00:12:22.651 --> 00:12:25.111
the earth

00:12:22.651 --> 00:12:25.111
is in trouble

00:12:23.781 --> 00:12:25.111
Can you read it?

00:12:25.111 --> 00:12:26.611
Th-The earth…

00:12:26.901 --> 00:12:28.121
is in trouble?!

00:12:28.121 --> 00:12:30.791
the earth

00:12:28.121 --> 00:12:30.791
is in trouble

00:12:31.451 --> 00:12:33.871
What? That's so dumb.

00:12:33.871 --> 00:12:35.751
Can I go? I have cram school.

00:12:36.211 --> 00:12:39.461
I know you are a prodigy, Child Emperor,

00:12:39.461 --> 00:12:44.011
but if you cannot grasp the danger,
it reveals how immature you still are.

00:12:44.381 --> 00:12:45.381
What was that?!

00:12:45.761 --> 00:12:48.221
Listen up!

00:12:48.221 --> 00:12:51.511
Madame Shibabawa's predictions are 100% accurate!

00:12:51.851 --> 00:12:55.891
She has predicted many catastrophes in the past.

00:12:55.891 --> 00:13:00.811
A few of them resulted in the loss of countless lives,

00:13:00.811 --> 00:13:06.611
but not once did Madame Shibabawa
use such dire terms.

00:13:06.611 --> 00:13:13.041
This will be something more dangerous
than a Dragon-level catastrophe or monster.

00:13:13.041 --> 00:13:15.791
And it will occur in the next six months!

00:13:19.421 --> 00:13:23.751
Okay, but we have no idea
when in the next six months.

00:13:23.751 --> 00:13:25.801
Yeah, hard to plan for that.

00:13:26.261 --> 00:13:28.221
You are correct.

00:13:28.221 --> 00:13:32.851
But I want you all to be ready for a fight in the next six months!

00:13:32.851 --> 00:13:37.561
"In the next six months" could
mean tomorrow, or even today.

00:13:38.391 --> 00:13:41.311
That's true. Who are you, anyway?

00:13:42.901 --> 00:13:44.311
Good thing I'm here.

00:13:46.901 --> 00:13:48.821
The building is under attack!

00:13:48.821 --> 00:13:50.321
That's impossible!

00:13:50.321 --> 00:13:52.161
This is the Hero Association HQ!

00:14:01.831 --> 00:14:05.251
A formidable fortress, to be sure!

00:14:06.711 --> 00:14:07.961
Time to attack.

00:14:07.961 --> 00:14:10.591
Hawk, Eagle, Falcon, Kite!

00:14:10.591 --> 00:14:11.841
Yar!

00:14:11.841 --> 00:14:15.971
Wipe out these so-called heroes and the land will be ours!

00:14:15.971 --> 00:14:17.351
We will dive straight in!

00:14:17.851 --> 00:14:20.351
Follow me, the Sky King!

00:14:21.191 --> 00:14:23.441
Father… Above us…

00:14:24.811 --> 00:14:27.611
Escape…

00:14:27.981 --> 00:14:32.071
Me, the Sky King,
killed like some worthless insect.

00:14:32.071 --> 00:14:34.121
Who could have—

00:14:36.121 --> 00:14:37.201
What was that?

00:14:37.201 --> 00:14:37.991
Who knows?

00:14:37.991 --> 00:14:39.791
It flew, so we killed it.

00:14:39.791 --> 00:14:41.211
That is good.

00:14:41.211 --> 00:14:43.581
Duty, protect, ship.

00:15:07.561 --> 00:15:09.941
Emergency power activated.

00:15:10.531 --> 00:15:11.451
What was that?

00:15:11.951 --> 00:15:13.741
What's going on out there?

00:15:14.111 --> 00:15:15.161
I don't know.

00:15:15.161 --> 00:15:17.581
All communications have been cut off!

00:15:21.911 --> 00:15:23.291
Impossible!

00:15:29.711 --> 00:15:30.921
Dad!

00:15:30.921 --> 00:15:32.551
It's okay now. Grab on to me!

00:15:33.551 --> 00:15:35.221
That's the way.

00:15:35.221 --> 00:15:36.641
Good job.

00:15:49.941 --> 00:15:50.941
What is this?

00:15:53.821 --> 00:15:56.201
There are survivors?

00:15:56.201 --> 00:15:58.281
Ship, failed to kill all.

00:15:58.281 --> 00:15:59.081
Then we kill.

00:15:59.081 --> 00:16:00.411
That is good.

00:16:04.541 --> 00:16:05.791
Get away now!

00:16:15.131 --> 00:16:18.051
You think I don't sense your thirst for blood?

00:16:18.051 --> 00:16:23.231
I accompanied Master Atomic and was waiting for the Class S meeting to end,

00:16:23.231 --> 00:16:25.771
only to meet thunder and destruction.

00:16:25.771 --> 00:16:27.101
Is this your doing?!

00:16:29.061 --> 00:16:32.361
D-Destruction levels at 99.8%?

00:16:32.731 --> 00:16:36.361
City A was destroyed in an instant!

00:16:36.741 --> 00:16:40.871
Who could have known her prediction would come true this soon?!

00:16:40.871 --> 00:16:43.621
Hey! Why was this building spared?

00:16:44.081 --> 00:16:47.041
We contracted Metal Knight
to construct this building.

00:16:47.041 --> 00:16:49.881
That's why it's stronger than the average shelter.

00:16:50.341 --> 00:16:52.381
So that's why there're no windows.

00:16:52.881 --> 00:16:57.431
We should go outside and see.
This must be what the prophecy was about.

00:16:57.931 --> 00:16:59.551
Master! Will you—

00:17:02.891 --> 00:17:03.971
Master…

00:17:06.691 --> 00:17:08.151
That's big!

00:17:08.151 --> 00:17:09.311
Are they aliens?

00:17:20.661 --> 00:17:23.201
So that's what blew the city to pieces.

00:17:28.331 --> 00:17:29.371
Go back to…

00:17:29.881 --> 00:17:30.461
your planet!

00:17:37.221 --> 00:17:39.301
A militant creature.

00:17:39.301 --> 00:17:41.101
Also cautious.

00:17:41.101 --> 00:17:43.471
Hurry. Let us hurry and kill.

00:17:43.471 --> 00:17:44.311
That is good.

00:17:44.891 --> 00:17:46.851
Is this thing immortal?

00:17:52.771 --> 00:17:55.191
Every strike is lethal!

00:17:55.191 --> 00:17:56.991
I can't beat this thing…

00:17:56.991 --> 00:17:59.701
Such a weak species.

00:17:59.701 --> 00:18:01.371
Easily killed.

00:18:01.371 --> 00:18:02.701
That is good.

00:18:03.081 --> 00:18:04.161
It's splitting?

00:18:04.161 --> 00:18:06.451
Damn, not now…

00:18:06.451 --> 00:18:08.581
I will dispose of this.

00:18:08.581 --> 00:18:09.921
You handle the rest.

00:18:09.921 --> 00:18:10.831
Very well.

00:18:10.831 --> 00:18:13.791
I will go kill those that fled.

00:18:13.791 --> 00:18:15.091
That is good.

00:18:15.091 --> 00:18:15.501
I—

00:18:19.091 --> 00:18:20.051
Master!

00:18:20.841 --> 00:18:22.931
Iai, you okay?

00:18:23.641 --> 00:18:25.431
You know, your left arm…

00:18:25.431 --> 00:18:28.891
Master! Swords have no effect on this monster!

00:18:28.891 --> 00:18:30.561
Forget me! Retreat!

00:18:32.861 --> 00:18:33.441
Outta my way!

00:18:39.071 --> 00:18:42.411
Iai! The path of the sword does not end for you yet!

00:18:42.411 --> 00:18:43.371
Stop your bleeding!

00:18:44.321 --> 00:18:45.121
Yes, Master!

00:18:54.501 --> 00:18:57.761
So there is a life-form on this planet that can fight.

00:18:58.131 --> 00:18:59.171
Excellent!

00:18:59.171 --> 00:19:01.761
Try to withstand our invasion!

00:19:02.381 --> 00:19:03.931
Planet, eh?

00:19:03.931 --> 00:19:06.011
You from outer space?

00:19:06.431 --> 00:19:09.181
And you got friends up in that floaty toy?

00:19:10.141 --> 00:19:11.021
Yeah, that's it.

00:19:11.641 --> 00:19:16.861
I doubt you alone have the power
to do all this to the city.

00:19:16.861 --> 00:19:19.531
Atomic Samurai, count us in.

00:19:19.531 --> 00:19:21.781
You the bastard that smashed this town?!

00:19:22.781 --> 00:19:24.571
And if I am?

00:19:24.571 --> 00:19:26.531
For all the beautiful men you killed…

00:19:27.331 --> 00:19:28.291
I claim vengeance!

00:19:31.291 --> 00:19:35.211
Each separate attack must be
delivered with the intent…

00:19:35.631 --> 00:19:36.211
to kill!

00:19:36.671 --> 00:19:39.961
Dark Angel Rush!

00:19:45.641 --> 00:19:48.851
Issue an evacuation warning to
City A and all neighboring cities.

00:19:48.851 --> 00:19:49.391
Right now!

00:19:50.771 --> 00:19:54.691
And expand the M-System vitals monitor
to cover all of City A.

00:19:54.691 --> 00:19:57.401
We need an accurate count of the survivors.

00:19:57.401 --> 00:19:58.731
What's the threat level?

00:19:58.731 --> 00:19:59.941
Dragon, without doubt.

00:20:02.281 --> 00:20:03.031
No…

00:20:04.701 --> 00:20:06.241
This might be a God-level threat.

00:20:08.701 --> 00:20:12.451
Four S-class heroes should be able to take care of the enemy on the ground…

00:20:12.451 --> 00:20:14.001
The problem is that thing.

00:20:14.001 --> 00:20:15.871
We can't reach it.

00:20:15.871 --> 00:20:18.921
Any aircraft would be shot down in seconds.

00:20:19.501 --> 00:20:24.381
King, you're one of the top fighters in Class S. Give us your take.

00:20:25.011 --> 00:20:27.141
Class S rank 7, King.

00:20:27.141 --> 00:20:30.061
Said to be the strongest man on Earth,

00:20:30.061 --> 00:20:32.811
and I see he is well respected by the other heroes.

00:20:34.891 --> 00:20:36.401
There's nothing I can do.

00:20:37.731 --> 00:20:41.401
It's too high in the sky.
There's no way to attack it.

00:20:42.441 --> 00:20:45.651
But the mysterious craft is currently dormant.

00:20:45.651 --> 00:20:48.161
We should use this opportunity to call in Metal Knight.

00:20:48.161 --> 00:20:50.781
What the—?! That's pathetic!

00:20:50.781 --> 00:20:52.871
Aren't you supposed to be the strongest man?

00:20:52.871 --> 00:20:54.371
Hey, Tatsumaki.

00:20:54.371 --> 00:20:56.671
If you piss King off, he'll kill you.

00:20:54.371 --> 00:20:58.881
This city's been blown away,
and you're just going to give them a free hand?

00:20:58.881 --> 00:20:59.671
Unbelievable!

00:21:02.671 --> 00:21:05.631
Forget it! I'll take care of this myself!

00:21:05.631 --> 00:21:07.431
Wait, I will go too.

00:21:08.391 --> 00:21:10.761
I do not know how effective I can be,

00:21:10.761 --> 00:21:12.561
but I will attack from the ground.

00:21:14.061 --> 00:21:15.311
Maybe you didn't hear me.

00:21:15.311 --> 00:21:16.811
I said forget about it!

00:21:18.191 --> 00:21:20.151
Take it easy, Genos.

00:21:20.151 --> 00:21:23.281
I understand how you feel,
but if you piss her off, she'll kill you.

00:21:23.861 --> 00:21:25.401
Very well.

00:21:25.401 --> 00:21:28.281
There is no need to team up anyway.

00:21:28.281 --> 00:21:32.241
Master has already boarded the enemy ship.

00:21:32.241 --> 00:21:34.491
Whether this is the prophecy or not,

00:21:34.491 --> 00:21:37.411
there's not a single evil
that Master cannot defeat.

00:21:37.411 --> 00:21:40.751
If such an evil had ever existed,

00:21:40.751 --> 00:21:43.671
then I assume humanity
would have perished long ago.

00:21:48.721 --> 00:21:51.471
Well done making it this far, intruder!

00:21:51.471 --> 00:21:52.641
But this is the end.

00:21:53.351 --> 00:21:57.391
You see, there is no way you can defeat me, Groribas!

00:21:57.391 --> 00:22:01.021
My Acid Breath will melt you away!

00:22:14.991 --> 00:22:18.121
Isn't it about time the boss showed up?

00:22:18.121 --> 00:22:20.291
Well, if he's alive…

00:22:31.641 --> 00:22:37.891
Hey, come back home soon

00:22:31.641 --> 00:22:37.891
nee hayaku kaette kite ne

00:22:45.191 --> 00:22:51.111
When my worries keep me awake under the crescent moon

00:22:45.191 --> 00:22:51.111
tameiki ga mikazuki wo yurasu yoru wa

00:22:51.111 --> 00:22:57.251
All I can do is close my eyes and think of you

00:22:51.111 --> 00:22:57.251
me wo tojite kimi no koto kangaete bakari

00:22:57.251 --> 00:23:00.291
I want to see you, I feel like crying

00:22:57.251 --> 00:23:00.291
aitai kibun nakitai kibun

00:23:00.291 --> 00:23:02.791
I feel so romantic

00:23:00.291 --> 00:23:02.791
romantikku na kibun

00:23:02.791 --> 00:23:09.341
I hope my feelings reach you

00:23:02.791 --> 00:23:09.341
todokete kono omoi

00:23:09.801 --> 00:23:18.101
I know so very well

00:23:09.801 --> 00:23:18.101
datte zutto shitteiru no

00:23:18.101 --> 00:23:23.311
how hard you always work

00:23:18.101 --> 00:23:23.311
ganbatteru koto takusan

00:23:25.021 --> 00:23:27.981
You're the one I love

00:23:25.021 --> 00:23:27.981
daisuki na hito ga

00:23:27.981 --> 00:23:31.111
You're so strong, yet still I worry

00:23:27.981 --> 00:23:31.111
tsuyokute shinpai

00:23:31.111 --> 00:23:37.081
Only I ever see your weakness

00:23:31.111 --> 00:23:37.081
watashi ni dake wa yowasa misete

00:23:37.081 --> 00:23:43.121
I'll find you before the stars

00:23:37.081 --> 00:23:43.121
hoshi yori saki ni mitsukete ageru

00:23:43.121 --> 00:23:48.961
Come right back home

00:23:43.121 --> 00:23:48.961
massugu kaette kite ne

00:23:48.961 --> 00:23:57.181
Hey, come back home soon

00:23:48.961 --> 00:23:57.181
nee hayaku kaette kite ne

00:24:00.021 --> 00:24:20.041
NEXT
TIME

00:24:00.021 --> 00:24:20.041
THE
DOMINATOR
OF THE
UNIVERSE

00:24:01.521 --> 00:24:03.521
I, Groribas, control this preview!

00:24:03.521 --> 00:24:06.601
I perfected some new moves.
Now I have like twenty!

00:24:06.601 --> 00:24:10.941
But I couldn't show them off, because, you know, they killed me off first!

00:24:13.151 --> 00:24:15.281
Next time, on One Punch Man : Episode 11,

00:24:15.281 --> 00:24:16.951
"The Dominator of the Universe."

00:24:16.951 --> 00:24:19.411
It's up to you now, Lord Boros!
